{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"1fe722e7b5f017479e68a4bcc0903fd4bd493f335f25d480d688919f87d1b635","ja":"やっぱり風花に","zh":"还是找风花吧","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2463a2129c7cda40cd29d9f1361feef9e262579712c66b5c397d533c584c3a53","ja":"その次の日……","zh":"到了第二天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"31b81006fbe68a09d6d86ab62bfb7c56a923ddd4cf675b95629f35af4b07944b","ja":"結局、風花さんには断られちゃったね。\n3人目のメンバー、誰がいいかな？","zh":"结果还是被风花拒绝了呢。\n第3位成员，找谁比较好呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b16a1182e76fc905dbc3cb62679334758f49b4f55e4aeac0c77d5faf2619db5c","ja":"いろいろ考えたんだけど、やっぱり、的確な\nアドバイスをくれた風花さんしかいないと思うな……。","zh":"想了许多，但果然还是觉得，只有\n给出了切中要害建议的风花小姐才最合适呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3f295eec52f695cd8be5ba1f572c0044316d114d5a252df693c5b78a11c9515d","ja":"そうだよね！　こうなったら、絶対に風花さんを\n勧誘して、『みらことふう』を結成するぞー！","zh":"说的也是！既然这样，一定要拉风花小姐\n入伙，组成“未来琴风”——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4048bd4ec1426f7cc0d2c69f6e84c50549bc4a5cc04b967553b882191a53a8f0","ja":"ふふっ、もう新しいトリオ名が決まってるの？\nでもその方が、風花さんを誘いやすいかも。","zh":"呵呵，已经定好新的三人组名字了吗？\n不过那样的话，说不定更容易邀请风花呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"eac364ba42c4714dc861c962b23773e0886512bf898b4bc5ac3d56b456f61c03","ja":"よーしっ！　それじゃあ、\n風花さんを探しにレッツゴー！！","zh":"好——嘞！那么，\n我们去找风花小姐，出发——！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"447a23fba27897e6961ce467dd9d2672272c2d1b2cae9e20e12f0f18a3a29911","ja":"あっ、風花さん！","zh":"啊，风花小姐！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b5f8a35aa6f769514c8ed0a9a6a9377fdbcdeefc387c69cde8df88fe7e247eb7","ja":"お願いします！　私たちのお笑いを高めるには、\n『みらことふう』になる必要があるんです！","zh":"拜托了！为了提高我们的搞笑水平，\n我们必须成为“未来琴叶风花”才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d4f498160f130b56057f2b9a03c55f3deba4130926186cc7e00d715c6fd19e59","ja":"な、名前を入れてくれたのはうれしいけど……\n無理なの！　ごめんなさい！","zh":"写、写了名字是很让人高兴啦，但是……\n做不到啦！对不起！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"392310392feb915c3d17b6ec600abc70392e382bcad465c5144d2fd71baf19c5","ja":"風花さん、一緒に漫才してくださ～い！　みんなを\n笑顔にするのって、すっごく楽しいですよ！","zh":"风花小姐，和我一起说相声吧～！让大家\n展露笑容，可是超级开心的哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"21b42a47ac716a857e003a3912fd2b86aa2641c3ef1644ef3118e8b8a716564c","ja":"楽しそうなのはわかるけど……\n恥ずかしくて、私にはとてもできないから！","zh":"虽然明白看着挺开心……\n但太害羞了，我实在做不来啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"f744a1cb82034a22da1e3b3b4aa2821e3556e4f2acd68e2cc835b00641390e51","ja":"はぁ……風花さん、なかなかOKしてくれないね。\nなにかいい方法ないかな？","zh":"唉……风花总是不肯答应呢。\n有没有什么好办法呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"5774c696f9f24556878d3b580999cc0c905aec4a347c0f535b1cf9d36617e237","ja":"う～ん……あっ！","zh":"唔～……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"162891fd7dae8aeac5be6e4c15f3a718864f1e4e3f8e5c0afda300357f876863","ja":"じゃあ、私がボケて風花さんにツッコんでもらって、\nそれを褒めて勧誘する、っていうのはどうかな？　","zh":"那由我来装傻，让风花来吐槽，\n然后夸奖她顺势劝诱，这个办法怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"8b0d47c628aaad33606dc745b0b97c110c2cff59d4eb2956d98b421bc27ea79d","ja":"そっか……うん、それなら風花さんも自信がつくし、\nすごくいい案かも！","zh":"这样啊……嗯，那样的话风花也能建立自信，\n说不定是个很棒的提议呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1351.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"d32e9159b6563fafd13664820e7b550f2a9f494f9e289e1398e42632e0eff48c","ja":"次に風花さんと会うのは、映画の宣伝をする\nお仕事の時だね。その日に作戦を実行しよう！","zh":"下次和风花小姐见面，是在宣传电影的\n工作时呢。就在那天执行作战吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
